  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Smelly Shoes—An Opportunity for Shoe Rack Re-Design (2022), published by Springer Nature, has been cited 1 time. Beyond that, it is used in teaching.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Smelly Shoes—An Opportunity for Shoe Rack Re-Design by Vikash Kumar and Sarthak Mittal was published by Springer Nature in 2022. It is part of the Design science and innovation series. Conceptually, the work connects to Clothing, Rack, Engineering, Architectural engineering and Mechanical engineering.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records 1 citation. Notable citing venues include BMJ.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">In teaching, it is discussed in 1 recorded lecture. It is recorded in 4 library collections.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\" data-wiki-books=\"verified\">The latest English Wikipedia check verified 1 article–work reference matches. These are references or bibliography entries, which may include other editions of the same work; they do not measure readership.</p>\n",
